flowchart TD
    subgraph "CLI Layer"
        CLI["Dispatcher (src/cli.rs)"]
    end

    subgraph "Shared API Layer (src/shared/)"
        EmailClient["EmailClient<br/>(Router)"]
        Models("Domain Models:<br/>Envelope, Mailbox, SearchEmailsQuery")
    end

    subgraph "Backend Adapters"
        ImapAdapter["IMAP Backend<br/>(src/imap/backend.rs)"]
        JmapAdapter["JMAP Backend<br/>(src/jmap/)"]
        GmailAdapter["Gmail Backend<br/>(src/gmail/)"]
        MaildirAdapter["Maildir Backend<br/>(src/maildir/)"]
        SmtpAdapter["SMTP Transport<br/>(src/smtp/)"]
    end

    subgraph "Network / Local Drivers"
        io_imap["io-imap (Rust Crate)"]
        reqwest["HTTP Client (JMAP/REST)"]
        fs["File System (Maildir)"]
        lettre["lettre (SMTP Crate)"]
    end

    CLI -->|"Commands (mailbox list)"| EmailClient
    EmailClient <-.-> Models
    
    EmailClient -->|Translates to| ImapAdapter
    EmailClient -->|Translates to| JmapAdapter
    EmailClient -->|Translates to| GmailAdapter
    EmailClient -->|Translates to| MaildirAdapter
    EmailClient -->|Sends via| SmtpAdapter
    
    ImapAdapter -->|IMAP Commands| io_imap
    JmapAdapter -->|JSON POST| reqwest
    GmailAdapter -->|JSON POST| reqwest
    MaildirAdapter -->|Read/Write Files| fs
    SmtpAdapter -->|SMTP Protocol| lettre
